  "disable_ai": true,
  "description": "Codex: Orks (11e) GRAB IT (Wreckas, 1 CP, your Shooting phase) through the real unit_has_shot window. Fixture ork11e_orks_active: P1 Orks ACTIVE. Setup-only privilege: P1's detachment is flipped to Wreckas and its stratagems reloaded. The Flash Gitz shoot Custodian Guard C through the interactive shooting flow (targets declared with the phase actions the shooting panel sends, then the resolution dock's Fast Roll and Complete Shooting buttons are clicked). Once their shooting has fully resolved the unit_has_shot window opens for Player 1: the StratagemDialog shows GRAB IT on the Flash Gitz with an enabled Use button. A real click spends 1 CP, locks the unit out of charging and opens the reactive-move panel: the player DRAGS a Flash Gitz model about 4.9\" toward objective obj_nml_1 (the whole unit moves, formation kept), the panel reports the move legal (ends within range of an objective, unengaged, coherent) and Confirm move finishes it. Asserts the CP delta, the charge lock (RulesEngine + the 11e charge template), the unit within range of the objective, the other actions refused while the window / the move are open, and the phase free again.",
